NAFUTA ONLINE MVP
1. Create a Supabase project.
2. Run schema.sql in SQL Editor.
3. Replace YOUR_SUPABASE_URL and YOUR_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY in index.html.
4. Deploy the folder to Vercel (or another HTTPS host).
5. Camera requires HTTPS and browser permission.
6. For production, add stronger profile/friend/privacy rules and storage for photos.
